WEBVTT

00:16:27.107 --> 00:16:31.486
If even some of these
explorations succeed,

00:16:31.486 --> 00:16:33.864
workers will gain dignity,

00:16:33.905 --> 00:16:36.491
economic security

00:16:36.533 --> 00:16:41.788
and the power to challenge
employers and politicians.

00:16:42.956 --> 00:16:44.416
The result?

00:16:44.708 --> 00:16:47.794
The resuscitation of the middle class

00:16:47.836 --> 00:16:50.797
and a far more equitable society.

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:52.758
Thank you.

00:16:52.799 --> 00:16:59.222
(Applause)